    "narration": {
      "1": "core-rtr-1 is the rack's uplink to the data-centre network.",
      "2": "fw-1 sits between the uplink and everything in the rack.",
      "3": "Two top-of-rack switches, A\u2026",
      "4": "\u2026and B. Every server is cabled to both, so one switch can fail.",
      "5": "srv-a01 to srv-a04 are the compute nodes.",
      "6": "Each one reports temperature, power draw and fan speed.",
      "7": "The panel colours a server by its WORST reading.",
      "8": "A hot server turns orange before it throttles.",
      "9": "nas-a1 holds shared storage for the whole rack."
